to do to us, according to our ways and according to our practices, so he has dealt with us.’”"},{"verse":7,"text":"On the twenty-fourth day of the eleventh month, which is the month Shebat, in the second year of Darius, the LORD’s word came to the prophet Zechariah the son of Berechiah, the son of Iddo, saying,"},{"verse":8,"text":"“I had a vision in the night, and behold, a man riding on a red horse, and he stood among the myrtle trees that were in a ravine; and behind him there were red, brown, and white horses."},{"verse":9,"text":"Then I asked, ‘My lord, what are these?’” The angel who talked with me said to me, “I will show you what these are.”"},{"verse":10,"text":"The man who stood among the myrtle trees answered, “They are the ones the LORD has sent to go back and forth through the earth.”"},{"verse":11,"text":"They reported to the LORD’s angel who stood among the myrtle trees, and said, “We have walked back and forth through the earth, and behold, all the earth is at rest and in peace.”"},{"verse":12,"text":"Then the LORD’s angel replied, “O LORD of Armies, how long will you not have mercy on Jerusalem and on the cities of Judah, against which you have had indignation these seventy years?”"},{"verse":13,"text":"The LORD answered the angel who talked with me with kind and comforting words."},{"verse":14,"text":"So the angel who talked with me said to me, “Proclaim, saying, ‘The LORD of Armies says: “I am jealous for Jerusalem and for Zion with a great jealousy."},{"verse":15,"text":"I am very angry with the nations that are at ease; for I was but a little displeased, but they added to the calamity.”"},{"verse":16,"text":"Therefore the LORD says: “I have returned to Jerusalem with mercy. My house shall be built in it,” says the LORD of Armies, “and a line shall be stretched out over Jerusalem.”’"},{"verse":17,"text":"“Proclaim further, saying, ‘The LORD of Armies says: “My cities will again overflow with prosperity, and the LORD will again comfort Zion, and will again choose Jerusalem.”’”"},{"verse":18,"text":"I lifted up my eyes and saw, and behold, four horns."},{"verse":19,"text":"I asked the angel who talked with me, “What are these?” He answered me, “These are the horns which have scattered Judah, Israel, and Jerusalem.”"},{"verse":20,"text":"The LORD showed me four craftsmen."},{"verse":21,"text":"Then I asked, “What are these coming to do?” He said, “These are the horns which scattered Judah, so that no man lifted up his head; but these have come to terrify them, to cast down the horns of the nations that lifted up their horn against the land of Judah to scatter it.”"}],"hasArtwork":false,"availableLangs":[]}]